{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:55:35+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T15:55:35+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Beiersdorf Aktiengesellschaft","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Household & Personal Products","country":"Germany","city":"Hamburg","website":"https://www.beiersdorf.com","employees":22326,"summary":"Beiersdorf Aktiengesellschaft, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and distributes consumer goods in Europe, the United States, Africa, Asia, and Australia. The company operates through two segments: Consumer Business and Tesa Business. The Consumer Business Segment offers skin and body care products. The Tesa Business segment provides adhesive tapes and self-adhesive solutions for industries, craft businesses, and consumers. This segment also offers its system solutions to the automotive, consumer electronics, printing and packaging, and electrical systems sectors. It operates an online store. The company offers its products under the NIVEA, Eucerin, Hansaplast, La Prairie, Chantecaille, Coppertone, Labello / NIVEA Lip / Liposan, ATRIX, 8x4, HIDROFUGAL, tesa, SKIN STORIES, GAMMON, Aquaphor, Elastoplast, and CURITAS brand names, as well as regionally focused brands. Beiersdorf Aktiengesellschaft was founded in 1882 and is headquartered in Hamburg, Germany. Beiersdorf Aktiengesellschaft is a subsidiary of maxingvest ag. Beiersdorf Aktiengesellschaft operates as a subsidiary of Maxingvest GmbH & Co. KGaA.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Beiersdorf Aktiengesellschaft, avec ses filiales, fabrique et distribue des biens de consommation en Europe, aux États-Unis, en Afrique, en Asie et en Australie. La société opère à travers deux segments: Consumer Business et Tesa Business. Le segment Consumer Business propose des produits de soins de la peau et du corps."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo